                "formula": "\text{Modal: } M + \\mathbf{be} + V_3 \\quad | \\quad \text{Perfect: } \text{have/has} + \\mathbf{been} + V_3 \\quad | \\quad \text{Continuous: } be + \\mathbf{being} + V_3",
